          "canonical_hash": "sha256:d5ec367cdfcef25f01cc80110bf9bb0eb3af67757ca70238a732ed8021e25dc9",
          "description": "Log a refund against a receipt already on your chain, as the SELLER. The ledger stores it as a PENDING refund entry that references the original receipt digest; the entry is NOT counter-signed or appended to the hash chain, and it has no digest or sequence number of its own. Nothing is edited or deleted: the original receipt and its chain position stay exactly as they were. ",
